
### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### Create a trip
POST http://localhost:8080/trips
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pickup": "Berlin",
  "destination": "Hamburg"
}

### Get an existing trip
GET http://localhost:8080/trips/1

### Get a non-existing trip
GET http://localhost:8080/trips/999

### Invalid trip ID
GET http://localhost:8080/trips/abc

### Invalid JSON
POST http://localhost:8080/trips
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pickup":
}
